cdi:DimensionComponent-categoricalAdditivity a rdf:Property,
        owl:DatatypeProperty,
        ucmis:Attribute ;
    rdfs:label "categoricalAdditivity" ;
    rdfs:comment """Indicates whether categories at a specific level can be combined to provide the value for their shared parent category. Value is True if categories can be added together (collapsed) to create higher-level categories.  

An example would be age categories. Five-year age categories can be collapsed into 10-year age categories."""@en ;
