    rdfs:comment "Indicates if the Statistical Classification is a floating classification. In a floating statistical classification, a validity period should be defined for all classification Items which will allow the display of the item structure and content at different points of time. (Source: GSIM StatisticalClassification/Floating)."@en ;
    rdfs:domain cdi:StatisticalClassification ;
